{"unit_id":"xia-sc__dsh-git#card-zh","repo":"xia-sc/dsh-git","commit":"ea1cf7fb59bffa9a7c71870e5dd27e2f87117ff9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@xia-sc/dsh-git 是 DSH Web 的 Git 管理插件，在当前会话工作区提供可折叠面板和输入框状态胶囊。它通过宿主 RPC 调用 git，支持查看状态与提交记录、切换或新建分支、拉取和推送、暂存全部更改、提交并查看文件差异，也可按所选模型起草提交信息。适合在 DSH Web 会话中直接处理项目版本控制；需宿主提供 Git，AI 起草使用宿主已配置的模型服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1567","lib/client.js:3534","lib/client.js:3546"]}
{"unit_id":"xia-sc__dsh-git#card-en","repo":"xia-sc/dsh-git","commit":"ea1cf7fb59bffa9a7c71870e5dd27e2f87117ff9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@xia-sc/dsh-git adds a collapsible Git panel and workspace status pill to DSH Web. It uses the host RPC route to inspect status, branches, commits and diffs, and to fetch, pull, stage, commit and push. It can draft commit messages through the configured host model. Git must be available to the host.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1567","lib/client.js:3534","lib/client.js:3546"]}
